  "details": "When you re-scale your avatar while being dead in the combat system breaks your avatar.\n\nTo replicate. Join a world with combat system enabled, like McDonalds (https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_6b77c061-a1bf-48eb-b107-c4d944490198)\n\nStand in front of a car and get hit. When you are a rag doll, scale your avatar up or down.\n\nWhen you then get re-spawned in the combat system. Your avatar will be contorted.\n\nVideo: https://youtu.be/Ow8v1iFnDao",
